# Images & Icons

**No custom image assets** unless the user provides them or a feature doc explicitly approves generation/upload pipelines.

## Allowed

- **Lucide** (`lucide-react` / `lucide-react-native`) for icons
- Platform vector icon sets where needed (e.g. `@expo/vector-icons`)
- Generated avatar stubs: initials + deterministic background color
- Placeholder blocks for missing images
- Remote images from your own API/CDN when a feature doc defines the source

## Not allowed (without user assets or documented pipeline)

- Stock photos or custom PNG/SVG illustrations bundled in the app repo

When assets are needed later, document in a feature doc and ask the user first.
